  "notes": "Image 1 is the bottom view (ST_GPIO 2x9, ESP_GPIO 1x9); its three 5-pin rows are unlabeled there and skipped. Image 2 is the top view; its side headers are unlabeled there and skipped. ST_GPIO rows print two names each (e.g. 'NSS PB5'); per rule 10 both holes take the row's names, with the port name (PBx/PAx) as label where one is printed. Rows 'PA8 PB3', 'PA10 PA9' and 'GND VCC' print two port/power names; the right-hand name (next to text 'PBx' column) was used as label."
